      <xs:annotation>
         <xs:documentation>For CIV - a float value indicating the value to which rounding is required.
i.e. 0 means round to a multiple of 0 units/shares; 0.5 means round to a multiple of 0.5 units/shares.
The default, if RoundingDirection (468) is specified without RoundingModulus, is to round to a whole unit/share.</xs:documentation>
